# 📊 Customer Segmentation using RFM Analysis (PySpark + Power BI)

## 🚀 Project Overview
This project performs Customer Segmentation using RFM (Recency, Frequency, Monetary) Analysis on an e-commerce retail dataset.

The goal is to identify high-value customers, loyal customers, at-risk customers, and inactive customers to enable data-driven marketing and retention strategies.

The entire pipeline is built using:

PySpark for large-scale data processing

SQL (Spark SQL) for RFM computation

Power BI for interactive dashboard visualization
